# Local environment: real server addresses, domains and API keys live here only.
# `.env.example` is the committed template. The glob covers per-target files such
# as `.env.kamal` — a deploy whose credentials must NOT leak into the process that
# `make run`/systemd starts from this directory, since main.go reads ./.env.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
